# Paperfect: configurable OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions providers.
# Set URLs, exact model IDs and your own keys in Settings or this file.
# Blank stage URL/model inherits PARSE; key inheritance only occurs on the same URL.
# Multiple keys are comma-separated. Never commit .env.

